:class github
    :field public ns

    ∇ Init arg
      :Implements constructor
      :Access public
      ns←⍎('github_',arg.id)#.⎕NS''
      ns.config←⎕JSON ⎕JSON arg
      ⎕←'[github.Init] cfg=',ns.config.id
    ∇

    ∇ r←Run nul
      :Access public
      ⍝ GitHub events are queued by webhook callback (github_webhook); polling trigger is a no-op.
      r←⍬
    ∇
:endclass
